  "body": "The request still returns 200 OK, but the warnings in the log are annoying. Here's some acceptance test output from another application. It does not post an empty object, which is expected by synapse, but otherwise not required according to the spec.\r\n\r\nThe acceptance test mixes synapse warnings with it's own output, sorry:\r\n```\r\n[DEBUG] Leaving room:  http://localhost:8008/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/!OBXEcMJhmdaVpKlHob:localhost/leave\r\n2018-06-23 23:08:59,469 - synapse.http.servlet - 176 - WARNING - POST-178- Unable to parse JSON: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)\r\n[DEBUG] Forgetting room:  http://localhost:8008/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/!OBXEcMJhmdaVpKlHob:localhost/forget\r\n2018-06-23 23:08:59,524 - synapse.http.servlet - 176 - WARNING - POST-180- Unable to parse JSON: Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)\r\n```",
